{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James, good catching up! Been a while huh? I made a huge call - recently left my IT job after 3 years. It was tough but I wanted something that made a difference. And now with this new job, I am happy about my decision. I am loving the new job!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-ca03217e58913d402426eb15", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:46.994086+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ca03217e58913d402426eb15", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ca03217e58913d402426eb15", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Great to hear from you. Leaving after 3 years is a big step - how did it feel?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-f7ddb30d6a113b9f99bb5857", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.028903+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f7ddb30d6a113b9f99bb5857", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f7ddb30d6a113b9f99bb5857", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: At first, it was super scary, but I knew I had to make a change and focus on things that align with my values and passions."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-1444c78026e5a157f2a39502", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.042761+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1444c78026e5a157f2a39502", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1444c78026e5a157f2a39502", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, John, that sounds really brave. I hope it brings you joy and satisfaction."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-9844fb02fb7733a85dbc4e57", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.063565+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9844fb02fb7733a85dbc4e57", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9844fb02fb7733a85dbc4e57", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, James. It wasn't easy, but sometimes you gotta take a leap to follow your heart."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-4c537220824ed69bcb933364", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.080358+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c537220824ed69bcb933364", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c537220824ed69bcb933364", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Taking risks pays off! Way to be brave. I'm proud of you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-0913385c680850a3c9840353", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.097421+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0913385c680850a3c9840353", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0913385c680850a3c9840353", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Your support means a lot. Lately, I've been thinking about what truly makes me happy, and I'm really drawn to the gaming industry. I'm passionate about it and it's time to turn that into a career. I want to become an organizer of tournaments for various computer games in our state. For example, for CS:GO. It's a new journey for me."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-580ffc3522c5805fecc49107", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.113460+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "580ffc3522c5805fecc49107", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "580ffc3522c5805fecc49107", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool! You always mentioned your love for gaming. What other game do you want to organize competitions for? And what`s your plan now?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-82aff32e3b97051db42d6c9f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.135831+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "82aff32e3b97051db42d6c9f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "82aff32e3b97051db42d6c9f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Also, I can host Fortnite competitions. I have already made some connections that will help me with this. My plan is to gain more experience and perfect my skills to be successful in this field."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-a07ca79f2e7cf6a91d88b409", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.154861+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a07ca79f2e7cf6a91d88b409", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a07ca79f2e7cf6a91d88b409", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sounds like a solid plan! Trying out different game genres can be a great way to widen your skills and knowledge."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-3dc7f9a5fafacb0c60a7127b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.175118+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3dc7f9a5fafacb0c60a7127b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3dc7f9a5fafacb0c60a7127b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! I am very glad that you support me in my new endeavor!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-b9724835183341f10f5b8ed5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.189588+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b9724835183341f10f5b8ed5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b9724835183341f10f5b8ed5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I will always be here for you! If you need any financial assistance or advice, please contact me!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-a2a46b8468c517030d4d424e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.205969+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a2a46b8468c517030d4d424e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a2a46b8468c517030d4d424e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I will definitely do this if necessary! By the way, what's new with you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-a6170f2d28647d23ab8dc52d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.220388+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6170f2d28647d23ab8dc52d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6170f2d28647d23ab8dc52d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yesterday I took my puppy to the clinic."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-52356ae00a75d7accbb68ebe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.234659+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "52356ae00a75d7accbb68ebe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "52356ae00a75d7accbb68ebe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: God, James, what happened to your puppy? Is it OK?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-cf675d76d312c43790444eda", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.247700+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf675d76d312c43790444eda", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf675d76d312c43790444eda", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Don't worry. This was just a routine examination. Also, the puppy was vaccinated to prevent him from catching the seasonal canine disease."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-d302ccbc265da140199accd9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.260959+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d302ccbc265da140199accd9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d302ccbc265da140199accd9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Phew, great that he's okay. It's great that you care so much about your pets!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-9d3ad3a95aa43aba25c2c201", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.277946+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9d3ad3a95aa43aba25c2c201", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9d3ad3a95aa43aba25c2c201", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: They are the source of my joy, so I will always take care of them!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-e94c872b8d5f2d48f85051a9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.294693+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e94c872b8d5f2d48f85051a9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e94c872b8d5f2d48f85051a9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: You're a great host, James! Well, I have to go, bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-17681f1e1f96273d47410748", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.308725+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "17681f1e1f96273d47410748", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "17681f1e1f96273d47410748", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks, John! Take care, bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-47/session_18-df6c3c8ee7a3a91b26437d5d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T08:19:47.327097+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "df6c3c8ee7a3a91b26437d5d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "df6c3c8ee7a3a91b26437d5d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
